# Cloudflare serves everything matched by the run_worker_first exclusions
# (wrangler.jsonc) directly, so the Worker's applySecurityHeaders
# (security-headers.ts) never runs on those responses and this file carries
# their policy instead. Two groups:
#
# /assets/* is content-hashed, so it can be immutable — but max-age is a day,
# not the year a hash could justify: this file can't tell a real chunk from a
# deleted one, so not_found_handling's SPA shell for a deleted chunk gets
# cached here too. A day bounds how long that wrong response can survive;
# must-revalidate stops a cache from serving it stale past that, so it
# self-heals with no manual purge needed.
#
# The root files are unhashed names (og.png regenerates, llms.txt gets
# edited), so they keep the hour the Worker used to give them via STATIC_CACHE:
# short enough that a deploy lands the same session. The favicon stays one of
# them rather than moving under /assets/ to save a rule: a fixed name in a
# directory served as immutable is the one thing the hash test there forbids.
#
# No sha256 for index.html's inline theme script here, unlike the Worker's
# copy of this policy. Nothing served by these rules is ever a document: the
# SPA shell served for a deleted chunk is fetched as a script, so the browser
# parses no HTML and runs nothing inline. Adding the hash would mean keeping
# it in step in two files to change nothing.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, immutable, must-revalidate
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://*.posthog.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://*.posthog.com; font-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://*.posthog.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

